# Threat to detect
A Kerberos Ticket-Granting Service (TGS) request is issued using the weak RC4
encryption algorithm. This pattern is a classic indicator of a Kerberoasting
attack, in which an adversary requests service tickets encrypted with RC4 in
order to extract them and crack the associated service account passwords offline.

